          "   Si dice che...",
          "      = They say that...",
          "   Si lavora troppo.",
          "      = People work too much.",
          "   Come si scrive?",
          "      = How do you spell it?",
          "",
          "English has no direct match — use",
          "'one,' 'you,' 'they,' or passive."
        ],
        "pronunciation": "Si vive bene qui."
      },
      {
        "page": 2,
        "total_pages": 3,
        "content": [
          "SI PASSIVANTE = passive voice via SI.",
          "",
          "Looks like impersonale but the verb",
          "AGREES with what looks like the object.",
          "That 'object' is actually the subject.",
          "",
          "   Qui si vende il pane.",
          "      = Bread is sold here.   (sg)",
          "   Qui si vendono le paste.",
          "      = Pastries are sold here. (pl)",
          "",
          "   In Italia si beve il caffè.",
          "      = Coffee is drunk in Italy.",
          "   In Italia si bevono molti caffè.",
          "      = Many coffees are drunk...",
